<tr><td bgcolor="#11154A" style="padding:27px 25px;background-color:#11154A;background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#553FBA,#2F5582,#11154A)"><div style="font:800 21px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">AI・行銷情報</div><div style="font:11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D6D4E8;padding-top:4px">AI MARKETING DAILY · HK / CN</div><div style="font:700 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66;padding-top:23px">MORNING BRIEF · 2026年10月26日 · 星期一</div><div style="font:800 28px/1.35 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:white;padding-top:11px">少一點 AI 噪音。<span style="color:#D3FE66">多一點行銷訊號。</span></div><div style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#EDEBF6;padding-top:14px">14 則新聞 · 精選 6 則 · 約 3 分鐘閱讀</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:25px 25px 13px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TODAY'S BIG PICTURE / 今日核心訊號</div><div style="font:800 19px/1.5 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:9px">本期三條重點：ChatGPT廣告擴張、Safari第三方身份解析防護、Canva自研圖像模型。所有數字與產品狀態按原始公告核實。</div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:6px">10月26日編輯覆核：保留原始消息日期，清楚區分已確認事實、媒體報道及行業觀點。</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:13px 25px 7px"><div style="font:800 23px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114">今日 6 大重點</div><div style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#656A73;padding-top:3px">TOP KEY HIGHLIGHTS · 依行銷相關度排序</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">01 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#apple-expands-safari-anti-tracking-0b7396" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Apple擴大Safari跨站追蹤防護：封鎖第三方身份解析基建</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Apple WebKit於10月19日說明，OS 27系列Safari與WebKit在網域層級封鎖第三方身份解析基建的連線以阻止跨站追蹤；並非所有廣告識別符一律失效。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">Media及Analytics團隊應盤點身份配對供應商，驗證Safari／OS 27版本追蹤變化，不要假設所有識別機制全面停用。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#apple-expands-safari-anti-tracking-0b7396" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">02 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#campaign-asia-examines-scam-ads-60c81c" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Campaign Asia：亞太AI詐騙廣告威脅品牌信任，驗證制度受關注</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Campaign Asia報道生成式AI令仿冒素材更易製作，並訪問亞太廣告業對詐騙廣告、廣告主驗證及品牌安全的關注；跨市場擴散速度尚難作統一量化比較。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">品牌安全策略需要覆蓋冒牌廣告及消費者被誤導風險，不只是一般投放版位相鄰性。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#campaign-asia-examines-scam-ads-60c81c" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #9A3A9E;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#9A3A9E">03 / 行業影響 &amp; 品牌案例 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#apollo-economist-finds-little-visible-f7d447" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Apollo經濟師：標普493企業財務指標未見明顯AI回報</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Apollo首席經濟師Torsten Slok於10月24日分析標普493的利潤率及人均收入走勢，認為尚未看到科技七大以外企業出現明顯AI財務回報；屬宏觀推論而非逐間企業因果研究。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">客戶問AI ROI時，應準備可重現的業務指標與測試設計，不要只引用節省工時或模型能力作為成效證明。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#apollo-economist-finds-little-visible-f7d447" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #39689F;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#39689F">04 / AI 大模型 &amp; 市場動態 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#chatgpt-ads-expands-89-countries-7eb202" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">ChatGPT Ads累計逾10萬廣告主，擴至89國；投放受眾須與整體週活區分</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">Media Planning可以將ChatGPT Ads納入市場適用性評估，同時向客戶清楚區分平台週活、廣告版位受眾和實際投放成效。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#chatgpt-ads-expands-89-countries-7eb202" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #7D266B;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#7D266B">05 / 即學技巧 &amp; 玩法 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#iab-hk-c26-discusses-how-7add93" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">IAB HK C26討論Agentic Commerce：品牌如何保持被AI發現</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">香港品牌可以小規模測試AI對品牌產品資料的引用方式，並觀察相關觸點是否真的增加詢盤。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#iab-hk-c26-discusses-how-7add93" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #7D266B;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#7D266B">06 / 即學技巧 &amp; 玩法 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#campaign-asia-opinion-argues-marketing-dc0f43" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Campaign Asia觀點：AI搜尋時代不應只以點擊衡量影響力</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">Agency報表應區分到達、互動及增量商業效果，避免以同一個指標解釋所有品牌影響。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#campaign-asia-opinion-argues-marketing-dc0f43" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:23px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="background:#EBE8FF"><tr><td style="border-left:4px solid #5A42F4;padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TEAM ACTION BOARD</div><div style="font:800 18px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding:7px 0 12px">今日可以跟進嘅方向</div><table role="presentation"><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">01</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">審核Identity Resolution供應商與Safari資料流，按裝置及系統版本測試配對和歸因。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">02</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">建立冒名品牌廣告監察、檢舉及法務升級機制，並保留取證紀錄。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">03</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">為AI流程設定增量表現、成本及可重現性指標，而非只統計使用次數。</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 25px"><table role="presentation"><tr><td bgcolor="#5A42F4" style="background:#5A42F4;border-radius:24px;padding:13px 25px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=cta" style="font:800 14px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:white;text-decoration:none">閱讀今日完整新聞 &#8594;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#151841" style="background:#151841;padding:24px"><div style="font:800 16px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">AI Marketing Daily</div><div style="font:12px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#E5E2EF;padding-top:8px">Curated by Carrie Hui · AI Marketing Intelligence</div><div style="font:11px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#B9BADA;padding-top:9px">本電郵為已發佈網站內容精選，原始來源請查閱網站。</div><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=footer" style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">在瀏覽器閱讀</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>]]></description></item></channel></rss>